 {\n        \"nama\": \"Purwanto, S.Kom., M.T\",\n        \"peran\": \"Anggota Tim Teaching\"\n    }\n]','2026/2027 Ganjil','1. Ammann, P., & Offutt, J. (2016). Introduction to Software Testing (2nd ed.). Cambridge University Press.\r\n2. Graham, D., Black, R., & van Veenendaal, E. (2021). Foundations of Software Testing: ISTQB Certification (4th ed.). Cengage Learning.\r\n3. Myers, G. J., Sandler, C., & Badgett, T. (2011). The Art of Software Testing (3rd ed.). John Wiley & Sons.\r\n4. Pressman, R. S., & Maxim, B. R. (2020). Software Engineering: A Practitioner\'s Approach (9th ed.). McGraw-Hill Education.\r\n5. Sommerville, I. (2015). Software Engineering (10th ed.). Pearson.\r\n6. International Software Testing Qualifications Board (ISTQB). (2023). Certified Tester Foundation Level Syllabus v4.0. International Software Testing Qualifications Board.\r\n7. International Organization for Standardization. (2011). ISO/IEC/IEEE 29119-1:2013 Software and Systems Engineering—Software Testing—Part 1: Concepts and Definitions. ISO.\r\n8. International Organization for Standardization. (2023). ISO/IEC 25010:2023 Systems and Software Engineering—Systems and Software Quality Requirements and Evaluation (SQuaRE)—Product Quality Model. ISO.\r\n9. JUnit Team. JUnit 5 User Guide. JUnit.\r\n10. Postman. Postman Learning Center: API Testing and Test Automation. Postman.\r\n11. Selenium Project. Selenium Documentation. Selenium.\r\n12. Fewster, M., & Graham, D. (1999). Software Test Automation: Effective Use of Test Execution Tools. Addison-Wesley.\r\n13. Crispin, L., & Gregory, J. (2009). Agile Testing: A Practical Guide for Testers and Agile Teams. Addison-Wesley Professional.\r\n14. Kaner, C., Falk, J., & Nguyen, H. Q. (1999). Testing Computer Software (2nd ed.). John Wiley & Sons.\r\n15. Black, R. (2009). Managing the Testing Process: Practical Tools and Techniques for Managing Hardware and Software Testing (3rd ed.). Wiley.','Sistem penilaian dilakukan pada CPMK masing-masing sesuai dengan rubrik yang dibuat.',5.00,15.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,'Setiap mahasiswa harus meraih nilai/ predikat 60/C untuk masing-masing CPMK. Jika belum memenuhi maka mahasiswa wajib melakukan asesmen perbaikan maksimal sebanyak dua kali.','{\n    \"Sub-CPMK 1.1\": {\n        \"bobot\": \"10.00\",\n        \"soal\": {\n            \"1791083862199617\": {\n                \"jenis\": \"AKT\",\n                \"pertanyaan\": \"Keaktifan dalam diskusi pembelajaran; kemampuan menjawab dan menanggapi pertanyaan; keterlibatan dalam kegiatan praktik; kemampuan menyampaikan argumentasi terkait teknik pengujian; kedisiplinan, tanggung jawab, dan kolaborasi selama pembelajaran.\"\n            }\n        }\n    },\n    \"Sub-CPMK 1.2\": {\n        \"bobot\": \"15.00\",\n        \"soal\": {\n            \"1791083866980539\": {\n                \"jenis\": \"TGI\",\n                \"pertanyaan\": \"Analisis kebutuhan pengujian perangkat lunak; identifikasi kebutuhan fungsional dan nonfungsional; penyusunan test scenario dan test case; penentuan test data; positive dan negative testing; penentuan expected result; serta ketepatan dan kelengkapan dokumentasi rancangan pengujian.\"\n            }\n        }\n    },\n    \"Sub-CPMK 2.1\": {\n        \"bobot\": \"15.00\"\n    },\n    \"Sub-CPMK 2.2\": {\n        \"bobot\": \"15.00\",\n        \"soal\": {\n            \"1791083903695663\": {\n                \"jenis\": \"LPR\",\n                \"pertanyaan\": \"Dokumentasi pelaksanaan Black-Box Testing menggunakan Equivalence Partitioning dan Boundary Value Analysis; White-Box Testing menggunakan Control Flow Graph, Cyclomatic Complexity, dan Independent Path; dokumentasi automation testing; pencatatan expected result dan actual result; status Pass\\/Fail; bukti pengujian; analisis hasil; dan kesimpulan praktikum.\"\n            }\n        }\n    },\n    \"Sub-CPMK 2.3\": {\n        \"bobot\": \"15.00\",\n        \"soal\": {\n            \"1791083898276762\": {\n                \"jenis\":